# `flutter create` derives a Kotlin package from <org>.<project name> and
# regenerates a MainActivity there every time it runs — which CI does on every
# build. The activity the app actually launches is the one under the package
# matching `namespace` in app/build.gradle.kts (com.kylebjordahl.igt), which
# `android:name=".MainActivity"` resolves against; this second copy is dead
# template output, so ignore it rather than committing a duplicate that has to
# be kept in sync.
app/src/main/kotlin/com/kylebjordahl/caretaker_app/
.cxx/

